      "- Extends architecture-typed prefix, paged, and block-disk L2 reuse for hybrid and mixed-attention families while keeping native exceptions explicit. TurboQuant is a KV-cache storage codec and remains distinct from JANG affine weights, JANGTQ/MXTQ Hadamard-codebook weights, and base MLX MXFP weights."
